<lb n="7"/>daß haben wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ablesendt</unclear> mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mehrem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vernomen</unclear>.
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Thundt</unclear> hierauf gegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vt</unclear>. und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">F</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear>
